+UrlProtocol uses `community.kotlin.libp2p:jvm-libp2p:1.3.0-codexcoder21-snapshot-42` from
+[kotlin.directory](https://kotlin.directory). It retains completed Netty future results when
+the listener task queue is full, including connection close results, and always terminates
+owned transport event-loop groups after failed channel closes. See the
+[completed-result change](https://github.com/CodexCoder21Organization/jvm-libp2p/pull/71) and
+[shutdown cleanup change](https://github.com/CodexCoder21Organization/jvm-libp2p/pull/93).
 
